::notice file=tests/gallery/gallery.md,line=1,col=1,endLine=1,endColumn=1,title=AISIGNS-METRIC-ANAPHORA-OPENERS::Same two-word opening repeated 4.0×
help: Sentences opening with the same bigram ('It can', 'This technology') form anaphora-like repetition; vary openers
::error file=tests/gallery/gallery.md,line=1,col=1,endLine=77,endColumn=97,title=GALLERY-FMT-DOCWINDOW::10 distinct trigger words cluster across the document
help: Vary the vocabulary; a document leaning on the same intensity words throughout reads as machine-generated emphasis
::notice file=tests/gallery/gallery.md,line=3,col=74,endLine=3,endColumn=75,title=AISIGNS-METRIC-EM-DASH-RATE::Em-dash density 10.1 per 1000 words
help: Em-dash density 10.1/1000 words exceeds conversational norms - reword the sentences instead; em-dashes as a default pause are a machine tell
::notice file=tests/gallery/gallery.md,line=9,col=1,endLine=10,endColumn=1,title=AISIGNS-METRIC-BULLET-BOLDLEAD::100%25 of bullets open with '**Term:**' lead-ins
